        KILL: WTI <$58 AND a borrowing-base CUT at the Oct-2026 redetermination / net-debt/EBITDAX >2.5x / oil volumes roll below ~19,000 Bbls/d absent a divestiture / Permian gas+NGL negative realizations deepen and swamp the oil netback (Q1'26 gas -$1.68/Mcf, NGL -$6.22/Bbl = ~21% of volume value-destructive)

